# --- Project data & artifacts ---
# Photographs and trained weights are not committed. The records that sit
# beside them are: the sheet a person writes, the YAML the pipeline reads, and
# the corners a person clicked, as docs/records.md sets out. Anything a machine
# proposed stays out, including the detector's own corner file, so that the two
# cannot be confused. Re-including directories is what lets those negations
# reach any depth -- a negation cannot reach inside an excluded directory.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/session.md
!data/**/session.yaml
!data/**/annotations/corners.yaml
!data/manifest.csv
models/

# --- OS cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Private notes: discussion, session logs, plans (own nested git repo) ---
notes/
